OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy and
OL,6,Foften damp end to the day with coastal
OL,7,Fmist and hill fog in places. Periods
OL,8,Fof rain and drizzle clearing
OL,9,Fsouthwards with skies gradually
OL,10,Fclearing overnight. Winds easing
OL,11,Fconsiderably and remaining rather warm
OL,12,Fin southern regions.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA fine day with a mixture of
OL,15,Fcloud and sunny spells, with some
OL,16,Fprolonged periods of sunshine
OL,17,Fdeveloping in places. Much lighter
OL,18,Fwinds than on Saturday and feeling
OL,19,Fpleasantly warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
