OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying generally dry early next week.
OL,7,FSunny at times but some cloud around
OL,8,Ftoo. Chilly nights at first with
OL,9,Fpatchy fog in the mornings but feeling
OL,10,Fwarm in the afternoons.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
